  "description": "Best friends, household pet, or just charity case? Hayoon has no idea what she is to Minju after all these years. She's grateful Minju's family took her in despite her being nothing but a lowly recessive omega, but her relationship with Minju sure is confusing. Minju does seem to like her, whispering sweet nothings in her ear and helping her out when she's in her heat, but who can tell? Ever the stereotypical rich alpha, Hayoon knows for a fact that Minju gets bored easily, that she loses all interest once she gets what she wants. Unable to tear herself away from Minju's grip, Hayoon unwillingly comes to harbor affection, albeit spiteful affection, for her friend... \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
